Mapping decisions:
- language_switch per_question: the candidate can switch between English and the opted medium at any time from the profile menu (bulletin Appendix III General Instructions item 5; Note 2.2).
- interface_profile null: the bulletin does not say whether Clear Response keeps a review mark (a required field), so the observed NTA screen details are kept below instead.
- numeric_input virtual_keypad: 'using the mouse and the on-screen virtual numeric keypad' (bulletin §2.4).
- exam_day.reporting_lead_min 120: 'report at the Examination Centre well in time i.e. 02 hours before the commencement' (bulletin §8.1).

